Grounded VLA is an independent research prototype.

KnowRob and openpi are external projects and are not redistributed here.
No Physical Intelligence model weights, robot datasets, or third-party source
files are included. The adapter implementations refer to their public APIs.

The RDF namespace https://example.org/grounded-vla# is a project example
namespace. It is not an official KnowRob or SOMA ontology.

The JSONL experience log is inspired by explicit episodic recording. It is
not a NEEM serializer and is not advertised as NEEM-compatible.

No affiliation with or endorsement by the upstream projects is implied.
